    Enhance NVFlare CLI commands and shared plumbing [Part 1 of 3] (#4449)
    
    ## Summary
    - add the shared CLI output, schema, error, and session plumbing used by
    the modernized NVFlare CLI commands
    - expand the CLI command surface for `job`, `system`, `recipe`, `cert`,
    `package`, and related config/startup-kit resolution behavior
    - extend Session/API wrappers and add focused unit coverage for the new
    CLI contracts and command handlers
    
    ## Scope
    - shared CLI plumbing
    - CLI command implementations and parser/help/schema behavior
    - config/startup-kit resolution used by CLI commands
    - command-level tests for the updated CLI surface
    
